PLACEHOLDER -- this filename is reserved for the KiCad PCB layout
(pcbnew) source for the LANCET thermal controller. The PCB build is
explicitly documented as optional in the paper (Section 4); the
reference build is breadboard-only.

The binary KiCad file will be committed in the v0.1.0 release tagged
for Zenodo archiving. Layout intent (2 oz copper on the heater trace,
0.1" screw terminal for the heating-pad leads, gate-source TVS for ESD)
is described in schematic.md.

